{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10257","headline":"长安晓望寄崔补阙 · 包何","name":"长安晓望寄崔补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢递山河拥帝京，参差宫殿接云平。\n风吹晓漏经长乐，柳带晴烟出禁城。\n天净笙歌临路发，日高车马隔尘行。\n自怜久滞诸生列，未得金闺籍姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}